BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.8 Tm /F3 10 Tf 14.2 TL .809286 Tw (GEOM therefore canonicalises every payload before hashing. The canonical form is produced by recursively sorting) Tj T* 0 Tw .488571 Tw (object keys into a deterministic order and removing insignificant whitespace, yielding exactly one byte representation) Tj T* 0 Tw .288667 Tw (for any given logical dataset. The approach follows the principle established by JSON Canonicalization Scheme \(RFC) Tj T* 0 Tw (8785\): serialisation must be a function of content alone.) Tj T* ET
