BT 1 0 0 1 0 89.4 Tm /F3 10 Tf 14.2 TL 1.617368 Tw (The economic corollary matters as much as the functional one, and it is also stage-dependent. For as long as the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.987059 Tw (protocol layer is unlicensed, its compensation is structured as flat licensing or subscription fees rather than as a) Tj T* 0 Tw .549286 Tw (percentage of amounts raised or of instrument value: transaction-based compensation is among the clearest indicators) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.900625 Tw (regulators use to identify brokering activity, and a fee that scales with deal size makes the infrastructure) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.706154 Tw (characterisation considerably harder to sustain. Once a GEOM subsidiary holds the relevant authorisation, that) Tj T* 0 Tw .471579 Tw (constraint falls away for the licensed entity \(a licensed broker may lawfully be paid like one\) and the group's revenue) Tj T* 0 Tw (model broadens accordingly. Section 7.5 addresses what that does, and does not, mean for $GEOM.) Tj T* ET
