.101961 .101961 .101961 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 89.4 Tm /F3 10 Tf 14.2 TL .753529 Tw (The engine's regulatory position is staged deliberately, and Section 8 attaches gate conditions to each step. Stage 3A) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.291667 Tw (operates as unlicensed technology infrastructure within a free-zone regime that accommodates non-regulated Web3) Tj T* 0 Tw .929474 Tw (infrastructure activity, on the strength of a legal opinion confirming that the SDK as scoped is not itself a regulated) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.072941 Tw (activity. Stage 3B is the licensing stage: GEOM subsidiaries apply for and obtain the authorisations required to perform) Tj T* 0 Tw .409286 Tw (custody, matching, brokering and register maintenance, on a working assumption of a three-to-four month application) Tj T* 0 Tw .082105 Tw (and approval cycle per jurisdiction. Stage 3C is the closed loop operating, every seat filled by a licensed GEOM entity,) Tj T* 0 Tw (with the instrument lifecycle running end to end inside the group.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 67.2 332.2 cm
q
.101961 .101961 .101961 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.8 Tm /F3 10 Tf 14.2 TL 3.127857 Tw (Two structural requirements govern the whole sequence. Each licensed function sits in its own incorporated,) Tj T* 0 Tw .322353 Tw (capitalised, separately governed subsidiary, so that an enforcement or solvency event in one does not reach the others.) Tj T* 0 Tw .548667 Tw (And every licensed subsidiary is ring-fenced from the Foundation, so that regulated-activity liability cannot reach the) Tj T* 0 Tw (ownerless entity that publishes the record, the record must survive any commercial failure in the group.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 67.2 267.4 cm
q
.101961 .101961 .101961 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.8 Tm /F3 10 Tf 14.2 TL 1.295 Tw (Nothing in the sequence assumes a regulatory outcome. Each transition is gated on an authorisation actually being) Tj T* 0 Tw .58 Tw (granted, and the sequence is designed so that failure to obtain one halts progress at that stage rather than propagating) Tj T* 0 Tw .882 Tw (risk into the layers already operating. This is a materially more capital-intensive and compliance-intensive path than) Tj T* 0 Tw (renting third-party licences, and it is chosen deliberately: the closed loop is the product.) Tj T* ET
